<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>单位圆上，sin 和 cos 就是坐标</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CFE0F5' }}>M2 · 核心概念</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 682, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <svg width={650} height={432} viewBox='0 0 650 432'>
                <line x1='110' y1='220' x2='540' y2='220' stroke='#3D7BD9' strokeWidth='2' />
                <line x1='320' y1='26' x2='320' y2='400' stroke='#3D7BD9' strokeWidth='2' />
                <circle cx='320' cy='220' r='165' fill='none' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='2.5' />
                <line x1='320' y1='125.4' x2='455.2' y2='125.4' stroke='#8FB6E8' strokeWidth='2' strokeDasharray='6 5' />
                <line x1='455.2' y1='125.4' x2='455.2' y2='220' stroke='#8FB6E8' strokeWidth='2' strokeDasharray='6 5' />
                <line x1='320' y1='220' x2='455.2' y2='125.4' stroke='#0E3F8C' strokeWidth='3.5' />
                <path d='M 378 220 A 58 58 0 0 0 367.5 186.7' fill='none' stroke='#0E3F8C' strokeWidth='3' />
                <circle cx='320' cy='220' r='5' fill='#0E3F8C' />
                <circle cx='455.2' cy='125.4' r='8' fill='#0E3F8C' />
                <text x='466' y='118' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='18' fontWeight='bold' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>(cos θ, sin θ)</text>
                <text x='388' y='150' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1E4FA8' fontSize='17' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>cos θ</text>
                <text x='464' y='178' fill='#1E4FA8' fontSize='17' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>sin θ</text>
                <text x='382' y='204' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='19' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>θ</text>
                <text x='155' y='248' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='15' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.65'>半径 = 1</text>
                <text x='548' y='226' fill='#3D7BD9' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>x</text>
                <text x='330' y='24' fill='#3D7BD9' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>y</text>
                <text x='320' y='418' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='15' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.65'>从 x 轴正方向逆时针转过 θ，落点就是 (cos θ, sin θ)</text>
            </svg>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>横向 = cos θ，纵向 = sin θ</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>sin / cos 不是“先有三角形再算边长”，而是<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>直接给出了一个点的位置</span>。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>把半径从 1 放大到 L</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>两个坐标同乘 L，就得到连杆末端：</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>x = L · cos θ<br />y = L · sin θ</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0E3F8C', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>L 决定“能伸多远”，θ 决定“伸向哪边”</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CFE0F5', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>这就是极坐标 (L, θ) 与直角坐标 (x, y) 之间的翻译。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 44, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.5 }}>第 2 章 · M2　单位圆与“角度坐标”</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman' }}>10 / 21</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
